#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kleopatra.appdata.xml:13
msgid "Kleopatra is an open-source certificate manager and graphical front-end for cryptographic services, primarily designed to handle OpenPGP and S/MIME (X.509) certificates. Part of the KDE ecosystem, it provides an accessible interface for managing encryption keys, signing and verifying data, and encrypting or decrypting files and emails."
msgstr "Kleopatra je an otvori-source certifikat manager i graphical front-end za cryptographic services, primarily designed u handle OpenPGP i S/MIME (X.509) certifikati. Part od  KDE ecosystem, it provides an accessible interface za managing šifriranje ključevi, potpisivanje i verifying data, i encrypting ili decrypting datoteke i emails."

